        <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">EPC data from energy audits pdfs (.bis files) – BIS Format for year &lt; 2019 (?): dataset of the REA pilot with 74 variables (Address, Air Exchange Rate, Air Tightness Test (q₅₀), Assessment of the building's compliance with regulatory requirements, Average Floor Height, Avg. Weighted U-value and 68 more). The pilot gave no description; this text is derived from its variable list.</dcterms:description>
        <dcterms:publisher rdf:resource="https://ontology.energy-guard.eu/pilots#REA"/>
