    <eg:codeList>see Step Legend; 0 = Boot; 2 = Standby; 3 = Duty; 4 = Adsorb; 5 = Adsorb Full; 6 = Saturated; 7 = Pressurizing; 8 = Back Flush Check; 9 = Heating; 10 = Hot Flush; 11 = Cold Flush; 100 = I/O Error; 101 = Heating Fail; 102 = Back Flush Fail; 103 = Check Valve Leakage; 104 = Pressurizing Fail; 999 = Service Mode</eg:codeList>
